# Mission 6: Marketing Autopilot Operationalization (Implementation Plan)

## Goal
Enable the operator to toggle the "Autopilot" loop on/off directly from the Nucleus HUD. This turns the system from a passive dashboard into an active agentic control center.

## User Review Required
> [!NOTE]
> The original plan referenced `marketing_autopilot.py`, but investigation revealed [scripts/autopilot_v2.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/autopilot_v2.py) is the functional orchestrator.
> I will hook the HUD toggle to control [autopilot_v2.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/autopilot_v2.py) (or a similar specialized marketing loop).
> **Decision**: I will modify `ResearchWidget.tsx` to include an "Autopilot Data" toggle. When ON, it will signal the backend to run a background job that fetches marketing data.

## Proposed Changes

### Backend (Python)

#### [MODIFY] [server.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tools/marketing-dashboard/server.py)
- **New Endpoint**: `POST /api/autopilot`
    - Payload: `{ active: boolean, type: "marketing" }`
- **Logic**: 
    - When `active: true`: Starts a background thread (or enables a flag) that runs [simulate_marketing_flow.sh](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/simulate_marketing_flow.sh) or [run_research.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/run_research.py) periodically (e.g., every 60s for demo, 6h for prod).
    - When `active: false`: Stops the thread.
    - Emits `autopilot_status` events.

### Frontend (Nucleus HUD)

#### [MODIFY] [ResearchWidget.tsx](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tools/nucleus-hud/app/components/ResearchWidget.tsx)
- Add a Toggle Switch (UI).
- `onClick` -> Calls `POST /api/autopilot`.
- visual indicator (e.g., "AUTOPILOT ENGAGED" pulsing text).

#### [MODIFY] [task.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/7c654df4-b83e-43f9-8620-f15868ec39d1/task.md)
- Update Mission 6 status.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Verification
- **Tool Test**: Use `curl` to `POST /api/autopilot` and verify it returns success.
- **Log Verification**: Check [server.log](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tools/marketing-dashboard/server.log) to see if the background loop is starting/stopping.

### Manual Verification
1. Toggle "Autopilot" ON in HUD.
2. Wait 1 min.
3. Check "Neural Feed" for "Marketing Insight" events.
